  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-29T22:42:35.080Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nIf you detach the Camera Lens from the Camera itself and then press the button to turn the camera around, the view will actually mirror instead of turning around. I'm not sure if it's a issue in VR as well (can't test it right now) but I experienced it with the Drone Camera in Desktop Mode.\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Open the Desktop Camera\n2. Fly around a bit with the Camera Drone (Middle Mouse Button)\n3. Press the button at the top of the camera to \"turn around\" your view\nIf you do this you will notice that the camera mirrors your view instead of turning around by 180°\n# Attachments:\nHere is a short video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/awtbys",
